WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.170 --> 00:00:01.570
- [Female] Do you like that?

00:00:03.390 --> 00:00:05.550
- We're going to be trying the Furbo.

00:00:05.550 --> 00:00:07.870
Which is a nanny cam for your dog.

00:00:07.870 --> 00:00:09.443
There's the capability
to look at your dog,

00:00:09.443 --> 00:00:13.420
talk to your dog, and to
throw treats for your dog,

00:00:13.420 --> 00:00:14.470
while you're at work.

00:00:14.470 --> 00:00:15.870
- I have two pugs.

00:00:15.870 --> 00:00:18.260
Technically because I recently moved out,

00:00:18.260 --> 00:00:19.350
they're my parents dogs.

00:00:19.350 --> 00:00:21.020
But in my heart they're still by dogs.

00:00:21.020 --> 00:00:22.430
- My dog's name is Olivia.

00:00:22.430 --> 00:00:24.180
She's a mini dachshund.

00:00:24.180 --> 00:00:25.520
- My dog is named Hadley.

00:00:25.520 --> 00:00:27.600
I have always wished
that I could text her,

00:00:27.600 --> 00:00:29.300
when we're apart, just to be like,

00:00:29.300 --> 00:00:30.690
hey, how ya doing?

00:00:30.690 --> 00:00:31.850
But I can't do that.

00:00:31.850 --> 00:00:33.500
Cuz doesn't have opposable thumbs

00:00:33.500 --> 00:00:36.220
and the ability to read or write.

00:00:36.220 --> 00:00:37.060
Which is a real bummer.

00:00:37.060 --> 00:00:38.610
- I used to be able to bring her to work

00:00:38.610 --> 00:00:39.620
every single day.

00:00:39.620 --> 00:00:41.090
So that's been rough on me.

00:00:41.090 --> 00:00:42.900
- I'm excited to sort of get that,

00:00:42.900 --> 00:00:45.610
oh my God, I'm so excited
to see you reaction.

00:00:45.610 --> 00:00:47.010
- She refuses to get a job.

00:00:47.010 --> 00:00:49.100
So I want to know what
she's doing with her day.

00:00:49.100 --> 00:00:51.410
- Hello from the floor
of my parent's kitchen.

00:00:51.410 --> 00:00:54.470
Me and Sophie are exploring
the Furbo right now.

00:00:54.470 --> 00:00:55.750
- I was worried it would be an eyesore,

00:00:55.750 --> 00:00:59.700
but it actually goes
really well with my stuff.

00:00:59.700 --> 00:01:00.533
- Do you like that?

00:01:00.533 --> 00:01:02.220
- It goes through some steps

00:01:02.220 --> 00:01:05.490
saying to get the dog acclimated.

00:01:06.760 --> 00:01:08.070
Have them sniff it out.

00:01:08.070 --> 00:01:10.230
I want to test throwing one of the treats

00:01:10.230 --> 00:01:11.850
to see how Olivia reacts.

00:01:13.327 --> 00:01:15.350
- I caught her sitting
in front of the Furbo

00:01:15.350 --> 00:01:17.800
because that's where the treats came from.

00:01:17.800 --> 00:01:19.780
- I didn't realize it threw five of them.

00:01:19.780 --> 00:01:22.410
- Definitely sort of
just like the fastest pug

00:01:22.410 --> 00:01:24.880
gets the treat, but
maybe that'll make them

00:01:24.880 --> 00:01:26.160
exercise a little bit.

00:01:26.160 --> 00:01:28.380
- And now for my least
favorite part of the day,

00:01:28.380 --> 00:01:29.370
leaving her.

00:01:29.370 --> 00:01:30.750
What a beauty.

00:01:30.750 --> 00:01:31.920
- Be good while I'm gone.

00:01:31.920 --> 00:01:33.365
- Now is the real test to see

00:01:33.365 --> 00:01:36.030
if it can cure my pug home sickness.

00:01:36.030 --> 00:01:36.975
- Bye.

00:01:36.975 --> 00:01:39.260
So I just got out of the meeting

00:01:39.260 --> 00:01:41.880
and I'm so excited to check on my Furbo.

00:01:41.880 --> 00:01:43.710
I was so distracted just thinking

00:01:43.710 --> 00:01:46.110
about how I just wanted
to get back to my desk

00:01:46.110 --> 00:01:47.112
to look at my dog.

00:01:47.112 --> 00:01:49.310
(laughing)

00:01:49.310 --> 00:01:51.070
- I'm going to throw a treat.

00:01:51.070 --> 00:01:52.430
Get her out of hiding.

00:01:52.430 --> 00:01:54.240
Look at how cute my dogs are.

00:01:55.140 --> 00:01:56.510
You can barely see them.

00:01:56.510 --> 00:01:57.760
She's so cute.

00:01:58.838 --> 00:02:00.780
This makes me really happy to see her.

00:02:00.780 --> 00:02:02.750
- Me talking to her
freaks her out I think.

00:02:02.750 --> 00:02:05.020
She keeps going to the
door to check if I'm there

00:02:05.020 --> 00:02:06.570
and being confused.

00:02:06.570 --> 00:02:08.030
So I think I'm going to not do anymore,

00:02:08.030 --> 00:02:10.120
because I don't want to make her anxious.

00:02:10.120 --> 00:02:12.120
- I think she feels a little bit confused

00:02:12.120 --> 00:02:14.260
when the camera adjust focus.

00:02:14.260 --> 00:02:15.710
I think she can hear the sound.

00:02:15.710 --> 00:02:17.530
And then she'll just stare
right up at the camera.

00:02:17.530 --> 00:02:18.640
It's a little funny.

00:02:18.640 --> 00:02:21.820
- My family is starting to
get a little creeped out.

00:02:21.820 --> 00:02:24.650
Because they'll be in the
kitchen where the Furbo is,

00:02:24.650 --> 00:02:26.660
and all of a sudden it
will start gargling,

00:02:26.660 --> 00:02:28.370
and spit out treats.

00:02:28.370 --> 00:02:30.410
- I feel a little bad
after the treats go out

00:02:30.410 --> 00:02:33.200
because she's still looking
at the camera for a bit.

00:02:33.200 --> 00:02:35.240
When I check back in it feels kind of sad.

00:02:35.240 --> 00:02:36.990
- I think I have given her something

00:02:36.990 --> 00:02:38.470
like 40 treats today.

00:02:38.470 --> 00:02:40.040
Which is not great.

00:02:40.040 --> 00:02:42.400
It's cuz the thing
dispenses five at a time,

00:02:42.400 --> 00:02:44.508
and I really want to know where she was

00:02:44.508 --> 00:02:46.520
and she was hiding under
the couch, or something,

00:02:46.520 --> 00:02:47.840
which she was.

00:02:47.840 --> 00:02:50.400
- Maybe it's just like this
longing to be with them

00:02:50.400 --> 00:02:52.260
that makes them seem extra cute.

00:02:52.260 --> 00:02:54.880
- I feel kind of like
I'm invading her privacy.

00:02:54.880 --> 00:02:56.640
- Night mode is kind of creepy,

00:02:56.640 --> 00:02:58.633
because I'll throw her a
treat to see where she is

00:02:58.633 --> 00:03:00.150
and she's under the
couch and all of a sudden

00:03:00.150 --> 00:03:01.680
I saw these eyes pop out.

00:03:01.680 --> 00:03:03.200
- It's a little weird
seeing her glowing eyes.

00:03:03.200 --> 00:03:04.033
- They look scary.

00:03:04.033 --> 00:03:06.850
They look like the twins from the Shining.

00:03:06.850 --> 00:03:09.130
Overall, we definitely love Furbo.

00:03:09.130 --> 00:03:10.920
Oh, you want a belly rub?

00:03:10.920 --> 00:03:12.030
- She did basically what
I thought she'd would do,

00:03:12.030 --> 00:03:13.930
which is alternate
between sleep on the couch

00:03:13.930 --> 00:03:16.280
and sleeping under the couch.

00:03:16.280 --> 00:03:17.790
- It felt like I was disturbing her.

00:03:17.790 --> 00:03:21.560
I'd check in and she'd
just be doing her own thing

00:03:21.560 --> 00:03:23.820
then I'd be pelting her with treats.

00:03:23.820 --> 00:03:26.460
- It did make me miss
her more during the day,

00:03:26.460 --> 00:03:28.840
but that's honestly the
life of someone obsessed

00:03:28.840 --> 00:03:29.673
with their dog.

00:03:29.673 --> 00:03:32.670
- I definitely liked it
more than my dogs did.

00:03:32.670 --> 00:03:35.710
My dogs didn't dislike
it but I don't think

00:03:35.710 --> 00:03:37.890
they knew that it was me talking to them.

00:03:37.890 --> 00:03:40.400
- She has complained
about her privacy rights,

00:03:40.400 --> 00:03:41.883
and I don't blame her.

00:03:41.883 --> 00:03:44.133
(laughing)

00:03:45.432 --> 00:03:48.015
(upbeat music)

